@node Getting Gtkdialog
@chapter Getting Gtkdialog
@section Download 
The maintained GTK+ 2 source is hosted at
@uref{https://github.com/abednarek/gtkdialog}.  The archived upstream
history is available at @uref{https://github.com/oshazard/gtkdialog}.

@section How to Install the Program
The program can be installed using the standard @command{configure},
@command{make} and @command{make install} command sequence.  Builds should
be kept outside the source directory.  A Git checkout must first be prepared
with @command{autoreconf -fi}; a release archive already contains the generated
files.  Further details can be found in the @file{README.md} and @file{INSTALL}
files included with the source.


